# Copy this file to .env.local (same directory) and fill in your own key.
# .env.local is gitignored; never commit a real key.
#
# Get a free Artificial Analysis API key:
#   1. Create an account at https://artificialanalysis.ai
#   2. Generate a key in your account's API / developer settings
#      (docs: https://artificialanalysis.ai/data-api/docs)
#   3. Paste it below. Keys look like: aa_xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx
#
# The key is only read by `/helm refresh` to pull model intelligence, pricing,
# and speed data. Without it, refresh falls back to fetching the public
# leaderboard pages, which works but returns less structured data.
AA_API_KEY=
